```json
{
 "name": "mini reactor demo",
 "origin": [
  200,
  150
 ],
 "clear_before": false,
 "parts": [
  {
   "id": "vessel",
   "box": "TTAN",
   "at": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "size": [
    60,
    40
   ],
   "hollow": 3
  },
  {
   "box": "water",
   "at": [
    "vessel.left+3",
    "vessel.top+3"
   ],
   "size": [
    54,
    34
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "heater",
   "module": "insulated_box",
   "at": [
    "vessel.right+4",
    "vessel.top"
   ],
   "params": {
    "element": "HEAC",
    "width": 6,
    "height": 6,
    "props": {
     "temp_c": 800
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "module": "wifi_node",
   "at": [
    "heater.right+2",
    "heater.top"
   ],
   "params": {
    "channel": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "repeat": 4,
   "at": [
    "vessel.left",
    "vessel.bottom+6"
   ],
   "step": [
    16,
    0
   ],
   "part": {
    "box": "brick",
    "at": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "size": [
     12,
     4
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "wall": "air",
   "at": [
    "vessel.left-6",
    "vessel.top-6"
   ],
   "size": [
    4,
    52
   ]
  }
 ],
 "then": [
  {
   "step": 60
  }
 ]
}
```

## Error contract
Every error is `{"path": "parts[3].module", "problem": "...", "fix": "..."}`. Paths point into the blueprint (`parts[i]`, `parts[i].module:NAME[j]` for expanded module parts, `then[i]`). Nothing is drawn while any error exists.

## Limits
{"parts": 512, "primitives": 2048, "steps": 32, "frames_per_step": 2000}

